<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.10.5">
<l>paiyara viṉaṇaip pāṟka ṭaluḷ</l>
<l rend="indent">paḷḷikoḷ kiṉṟa parama mūrtti</l>
<l>uyyavu lakupaṭaik kavē ṇṭi</l>
<l rend="indent">untiyil tōṟṟiṉāy nāṉmu kaṉai</l>
<l>vaiya maṉicaraip poyyeṉ ṟeṇṇik</l>
<l rend="indent">kāla ṉaiyumuṭa ṉēpa ṭaittāy</l>
<l>aiyavi ṉiyeṉṉaik kākka vēṇṭum</l>
<l rend="indent">araṅkat taravaṇaip paḷḷi yāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Supreme Form who sleeps in the milk ocean</l>
<l rend="indent">on a hooded serpent bed!</l>
<l>Wanting to create and redeem the world,</l>
<l rend="indent">you birthed the four-faced one in your navel.</l>
<l>Knowing that earthly men are unstable,</l>
<l rend="indent"> you created Yama together [with them].</l>
<l>O Wonder! Now you must protect me,</l>
<l rend="indent">Sleeper on the serpent bed in Araṅkam.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
